<title>CHINA: HACTL's operations manager takes early retirement.</title>
<headline>HACTL's operations manager takes early retirement.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The general operations manager of Hong Kong Air Cargo Terminals Ltd (HACTL) for the past 13 years, Tony Morris told Reuters he is taking early retirement at the end of the current month.</p>
<p>Morris will be initially be replaced by Stephen Kuk, currently manager of HACTL's Terminal 2 until another senior HACTL cargo executive, Johnnie Wong, takes over as Morris's successor later this year.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
